| 侧                  | 完成对象                      | 微观 lift               | 关系                         |
| ------------------ | ------------------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------- |
| prime local        | \((1-p^{-s})^{-1}\)       | binary bits           | 独立                         |
| prime local        | \((1-p^{-s})^{-1}\)       | Zeckendorf bits       | nearest-neighbor exclusion |
